# only claude-md and skill-link can write
spec: Finders; Fixes
args: agent-files --write stale-skill
exit: 2
-- @stderr --
necro: agent-files: --write goes with claude-md and skill-link: necro agent-files [--write [--only-at <file>]] (claude-md|claude-md-alone|skill-link|skill-misplaced|skill-frontmatter|other-instructions|rule-reference|stale-skill)
